commit.message:
fix: generate kessoku.Inject as variable declaration

Change the output format from function declaration to variable
declaration to match kessoku's expected usage pattern:

Before:
  func InitializeApp() (*App, error) {
      return kessoku.Inject[*App](...)
  }

After:
  var _ = kessoku.Inject[*App]("InitializeApp", ...)

Also fix struct field ordering in WireProviderFunc and WireSetRef.

🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

